  <item>
    <title>NO.17 对谈脱口秀新人：为什么越来越多人爱看脱口秀？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63391b159186d4e4c46a08de</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63391b159186d4e4c46a08de</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Oct 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你有去过线下的脱口秀现场，与众人一起听段子大笑吗？随着这几年喜剧市场的火热，越来越多的年轻人开始尝试脱口秀，小小的一方舞台，一束聚光灯下，诞生了很多关于平凡人的、诙谐中夹杂着苦闷的段子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中，我们特意邀请了一位讲单口喜剧仅三个月的新人——陈述，请他来谈谈进入喜剧行业的机缘巧合。节目中，我们将以“创作者”的对谈视角，和作为“普通观众”的视角，两面性地展现我们对脱口秀的看法和理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位朋友在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 喜剧新人陈述：为什么会喜欢脱口秀？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 其实，社恐才会做脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 喜剧创作面临的痛苦：无法把握的笑点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 陈述：线下跟观众之间会产生共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 丽媛：脱口秀是真正贴近你的生活的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 喜剧的内核不是悲剧，喜剧的存在才是悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 平凡生活的挫折，需要解构和安慰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> 脱口秀能够给予观众勇气和力量吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 脱口秀的大火：商业化带来的阴影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a>“冒犯也是一种沟通”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">51:16</a> 冒犯的边界需要空间不断碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多关于脱口秀的深度内容，欢迎下载Vista看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈述 陈丽媛</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Keep It Coming- Amphibious ZooMusic</span></p><span></span><p><span>Big Stones- Amphibious Zoo Music</span></p>]]></description>
