  <item>
    <title>NO.16 西方有奇幻剧？那么东方呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63368ab1e67030aadb38e77b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63368ab1e67030aadb38e77b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Oct 2022 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在奇幻剧的异世界里，驭龙驰骋翱翔，我们跟随角色“在崩坏的世界里寻找光”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着《龙之家族》《指环王：力量之戒》在流媒体上线，两大奇幻IP的对决，也唤起了我们在多年前观看奇幻剧的震撼。当一段用想象力浇筑的，厚重却充满细节的历史在你面前展开时，用泉老师的话来说就是，看着太爽了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请了封面故事的两位撰稿编辑，一起回顾了两大奇幻剧经典——权力的游戏和指环王。而当中国影视剧遭遇“奇幻”这个西方概念时，又产生了什么样的变体？国产奇幻剧又面临着什么样的困境和机遇？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位朋友在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 怎么定义奇幻剧？超自然与类型杂糅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 厚重的史诗：漫谈权游与指环王系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> “凡人终有一死”：宿命悲剧的震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> &nbsp;指环王：黑暗中的光与希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 奇幻剧的魅力在哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> “中国奇幻最大的问题是没有完整的体系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 为何国内奇幻大多局限在小情小爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">40:37</a> 国内电影工业能够撑起史诗制作吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">48:07</a> 奇幻文化在国内会水土不服吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多“奇幻剧”的深度内容，欢迎查阅本期看天下杂志的封面故事。或下载Vista看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期杂志封面】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkD7c7uuigTDv4qEEzr9X8lucmIt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>泉的向日葵王琳</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Main Titles- Ramin Djawadi</span></p><span></span><p><span>Siuil A Ruin-Anúna</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llLoxKPe0Zjg0N1h-GdblBPB2uQa.m4a" length="49853847" type="audio/mp4"/>
