  <item>
    <title>NO.14 我得病了，我想开了，我躺平了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632d886be67030aadb38e338</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632d886be67030aadb38e338</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Sep 2022 10:20:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在当代社会，保持身心健康似乎越来越成为一种奢望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>抑郁、失眠、颈椎病、胃炎、心梗……层出不穷的疾病，在近十几年出现普遍化、年轻化的趋势。身体是一个整一的系统，精神和肉体的病痛往往是同时的。种种“现代病”的流行或许意味着这是一个由于“人”被忽视而出现反弹的时代。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博用户少女大狮仔说：“你出生时就已经配备了一个将要伴你一生的宠物，这个宠物，就是你的身体，我们给她一个名字，叫大乖。”或许我们都要学会爱这个“大乖”，把身体当成自己的宠物去关心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目“现代病交流大会”，我们聊到自己曾经历或见证的现代病，以及因此产生的关于疾病、现代性、原生家庭等的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 公司体检：收获了两个肾上小水泡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 我在肿瘤医院看乳腺结节以为得了癌症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 我得病了，我想开了，我躺平了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 去污名化：抑郁不是不努力，就是生病了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 长囊肿和得抑郁的耻感是不同的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 抑郁随时可能把你吞下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 冥想让身体诚实，情绪收拢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 专访豆瓣“睡眠障碍小组”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a> 童年归因与自我和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 为什么抑郁？现代性与经济周期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a> 肉身疾病：营养过剩与生活不规律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3517">58:37</a> 过劳猝死的年轻人与心梗的金融街白领</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3887">64:47</a> 颈椎病年轻化：与疼痛共存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4328">72:08</a> 健康和疾病都是日积月累的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多有关“失眠症”的深度采访，欢迎下载看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>林芸 佳一</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林杨攀</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Edison - Tear Drops to Earth</span></p><span></span><p><span>LiZhi - 看见</span></p>]]></description>
