  <item>
    <title>NO.13 重返千禧年：假怀旧，还是真流行？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632168f78212a6185470e5d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632168f78212a6185470e5d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Sep 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提起千禧风，你会想起什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一时间，网络上流行着一种Y2K辣妹穿搭，芭比粉和紧身上衣成为一种新的时尚。20年后，人们重新回忆起“千禧”这个古早的词汇，时空一下子穿越回世纪之交，那个时候的人们对未来似乎怀抱着赤诚的憧憬和希望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现如今，被重新唤起的“千禧风”到底意味着什么？它是被一种时尚产业制造出来的新符号；还是依然留存着那个时代迸发的生命力？本期节目我们邀请了编辑部的两位老师，一起回忆往昔“千禧”的流行风貌，解读怀旧现象和情绪背后的成因。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位听众在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> Kpop也在搞千禧风了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 千禧影音大回顾：“千禧是少女的千禧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 世纪之交：对科技的未来想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> 千禧的时代情绪：“一切都在走上坡路”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> 千禧的生命力如今依然存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 千禧也有它的暗面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 当人们越来越爱怀旧，意味着创造力的枯竭吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 怀旧是一种精神慰藉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2691">44:51</a> “每个人的黄金时代都是以前的时代”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 一个脑洞：20年后的人们会怀旧我们的什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多看天下杂志的深度内容，欢迎下载Vista看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>王一平 赖逸翰</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家来恋爱—徐怀钰、刘若英、孔令奇</span></p><span></span><p><span>Happy 2000—黎明</span></p><span></span><p><span>静止—花儿乐队</span></p>]]></description>
