  <item>
    <title>NO.12 嬉皮士、乌托邦与天价VIP：曾经的音乐节一去不返了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6316c3794337559012241209</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6316c3794337559012241209</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Sep 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>因为2999的VIP天价票，晓峰音乐公社被乐迷们喷成了筛子。大火的告五人乐队，一张livehouse的巡演票价高达380，12个城市却场场售罄。有人调侃，不是“爱人错过”，而是“穷人错过”。曾经80块就能嗨一天的时代似乎一去不返，音乐节也不再是独属嬉皮士们的乌托邦。本期播客我们和编辑部的两位老师一起“忆苦思甜”，从古早迷笛聊到阿那亚音乐节，回溯“在现场”的那些时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位听众朋友在评论区分享你们的音乐节体验~</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期节目有部分删减，欢迎在喜马拉雅、网易云或QQ音乐收听完整版。（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4616">76:56</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 音乐节为何天价？晓峰音乐公社最好骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 亚逼军训：不堪回首音乐节记忆大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 地域烙印：北京乐队“混蛋”，南方乐队温柔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 乐夏现场观众爆料：张亚东不待见五条人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 沉浸与抽离：动容瞬间与格格不入的“局外人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">48:31</a> 十八线县城音乐节奇观：市委书记致辞、单位发票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 亚文化杂糅对撞：粉圈、滚圈与嘻哈圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3740">62:20</a> 古早迷笛：绿皮火车、五块盒饭与三块啤酒的平民时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4287">71:27</a> 苏联是被一场音乐节搞垮的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4336">72:16</a> 电音节失控现场：威士忌当啤酒喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4541">75:41</a> 摇滚社会学：我们要震翻社会学院大楼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4615">76:55</a> 酷儿合唱团：保安大爷拉掉演出电闸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4671">77:51</a> 从叛逆到浪漫化：被收编的亚文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多有关音乐节的深度文章，欢迎下载看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨、佳一</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>曹颖、韩轩</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>David Bowie - All the Young Dudes (Live)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Queen - Another One Bites the Dust</span></p><span></span><p><span>Queen,Michael Jackson - There Must Be More To Life Than This (William Orbit Mix)</span></p>]]></description>
