  <item>
    <title>NO.10 先聊哲学再谈情？迷人又危险的智性恋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630c921f0d43f7f6306c6b93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">630c921f0d43f7f6306c6b93</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Aug 2022 10:17:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“智性恋”，一个近期在社交媒体再度翻红的词汇。一时间，草包美人不再被青睐，大脑聪明才是真的性感，就连所谓的“智性恋穿搭”都被安排得明明白白。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你觉得自己是智性恋吗？智商真的能成为一种新的性感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家所谓的“智”，是IQ检测报告，是流畅的逻辑表达，还是生活中所展现出来的文化资本符号呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请了《Vista看天下》杂志的一位“智性恋”编辑和“非智性恋”编辑，聊天的时候发现，“智性恋”远没有表面展现出来的时髦和甜蜜，而是隐藏着可能会扎伤人的陷阱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位听众在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 智性恋编辑现身说法：“被很多清华男生伤透了心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 跟聪明人谈恋爱能获得什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 学历是第一道筛子？背后是隐藏的阶级和财富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 智性恋是更高级的？被展示的消费符号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 智性恋的出现也是一种思想进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 颜性恋被鄙视？智慧是稀缺且神秘的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 智性恋背后的性别差异：女性为什么不是更聪明的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 智性恋背后的权力关系，亲密关系中的隐患</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> X性恋只是吸引的起点，感情是更复杂的</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多看天下杂志的深度内容，欢迎下载Vista看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>田思奇 陈光</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>通り道—BLU-SWING</span></p><span></span><p><span>Be Mine—Jazzinuf</span></p>]]></description>
