  <item>
    <title>NO.8 恋综奥义：原来别人谈恋爱这么好看！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ff0ab92427ab3f84afabfc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ff0ab92427ab3f84afabfc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Aug 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么恋综这么火？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当有人对婚恋综艺的印象还停留在《非诚勿扰》的灭灯亮灯时，转眼几年间恋综已经发展成了无所不包的“星素结合”真人秀类型。暧昧的、心动的、分手的、离婚的、恋综已然变成了一个个供人们观看人际关系的试验场，甜蜜的爱情让人磕得不能自拔，而综艺结束后的“塌房”分手，也常常是一地鸡毛……</span></p><span></span><p><span>据不完全统计，今年各卫视平台预计将推出18档恋综，高校自制恋综也高达20多档。</span></p><span></span><p><span>别人谈恋爱有那么好看吗？爱情为什么这么吸引人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请了《Vista看天下》文化组的三位老师，一起聊聊恋综的魅力和陷阱，以及其背后呈现出的年轻人全新的婚恋态度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位听众在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a> 高校都开始做恋综了！追得过来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">3:39</a> 恋综作为“她综艺”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">4:48</a> 磕CP之奥秘：爱的感觉和情感代偿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">9:52</a> 恋综与真实恋爱之间的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 恋综进化史和婚恋观变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 恋综CP塌房？其实分手才是真实的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 素人的精英化：恋综是另一种偶像剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 生产“工业糖精”：恋综的剧情设置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a>“爱情的根本在于不确定性”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> “热恋冷婚”：年轻人对爱情的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> 独立女性和恋爱之间怎么平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">46:56</a> 男性对亲密关系的学习依然不够</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多有关恋爱综艺的内容，欢迎于8月26日关注看天下杂志推出的封面故事。或下载Vista看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz"><span>open3.vistastory.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨 林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>李彤 朱珂影 谢曼舒</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Friday I’m In Love—TheCure</span></p><span></span><p><span>Talk About Love—CallumBeattie</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkbaHqNb7kDokRtZIy6TumpzAH5o.m4a" length="51681776" type="audio/mp4"/>
