  <item>
    <title>NO.5 挺进“宇宙尽头”：进体制是最优解吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62e3b23188a3150c3ae3516a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62e3b23188a3150c3ae3516a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Jul 2022 10:10:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于考公，有这么几句流传很广的话——</span></p><span></span><p><span>“实在不行，就去考个公务员。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“宇宙的尽头是编制，编制的尽头是考公。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“考公是一座围城，里面的人想出来，外面的人想进去。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>短短三句，可以概括当代年轻人对考公矛盾复杂的态度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面临疫情和经济环境等现状，考公再次成为毕业生的热门选项。</span></p><span></span><p><span>考公热背后是怎样的时代变化？上岸后的年轻人们将面对什么挑战？</span></p><span></span><p><span>潮起潮落，我们最终能把握住的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位朋友在评论区与我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span>-“时代变了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">2:50</a> 90s初生人：考公曾是鄙视链底端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 97年生人：见证考公浪潮兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> 选调生制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 01年生人：考研考公的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span>-顺利上岸后，面对的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 人际关系是第一关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 转行的沉没成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 体制内的晋升渠道</span></p><span></span><p><span>-为什么宇宙的尽头变成了考公？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 扩招政策与考公诉求相碰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 考公的门槛相对较低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 随大流的被动选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 试错机会减少、选择节点提前</span></p><span></span><p><span>-年轻人如何面对职场新环境？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> 有矛盾未尝不是好事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 有些问题不论体制内外都存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 学习和成长是最重要的</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多有关考公的独家深度内容，欢迎下载看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fhi9moqHJz4vWkKXQ7P0XuP3z-7l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz">open3.vistastory.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨、佳一</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈光、王一平</span></p>]]></description>
