  <item>
    <title>NO.4《祝你好运，里奥·格兰德》：你有过性耻感和性焦虑吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62df5e65fa15142e1725201f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62df5e65fa15142e1725201f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Jul 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当代大龄女性究竟在面临什么样的性困境？豆瓣高分电影《祝你好运，里奥·格兰德》通过呈现一位55岁女性招男妓的故事，探讨了女性应当如何看待自己的身体和欲望。这部电影确有动人之处，但又是否过于轻盈，像个糖纸包装的童话？在中文语境下，大龄女性又面对了哪些性耻感和性焦虑，它们应当如何被书写和讨论？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请了《Vista看天下》杂志影视部的三位编辑，从这部电影的视角出发，一起来谈谈作为女性和男性，各自在生活中面临过的身材、年龄焦虑和性羞耻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位朋友在评论区和我们交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">2:13</a> Nancy性羞耻的源头：他人的隐形在场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">3:45</a> 瘦腿往事：为什么女生总关注身材缺点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">6:40</a> 北方澡堂和香港电影：谁在定义身材？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 男性也会在意自己腿粗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 阳刚气质设下的男性标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> “电影只是童话”：日本牛郎产业背后的pua</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 性耻感与道德：被建构的厌女情节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 性耻感与错误的家庭教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 亲密关系与性的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 色情电影的观看：为什么男性耻感很弱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a> “女人到了一定岁数，自动默认性魅力丧失”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 年长男性的金钱和权力赋能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 科学的性教育依然非常缺乏</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多解析电影的独家深度内容，欢迎下载看天下APP，解锁电子杂志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期杂志购买链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span>杂志购买链接：<a data-url="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz" href="https://open3.vistastory.com/web/webproject/sharedetail/index.html#/mags?channel=xyz">open3.vistastory.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>柳庆雨、林芸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>泉的向日葵、王迟到、王一平</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>I’m A Dreamer – ALIBI Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stay High – Brittany Howard</span></p>]]></description>
